  "body": "Summer afternoons on the deck, sea views stretching down to Gulf Harbour Marina and a peaceful, private garden where the kids and pets can play freely. Right in the heart of Gulf Harbour, this is family living with a little extra magic. With four double bedrooms, generous storage throughout and a freehold site with fully fenced backyard. There's room for everyone to spread out, space to entertain and every reason to slow down and enjoy the best of home.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Four double bedrooms, 3 downstairs and one upstairs\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living flowing to covered deck\r\n* Sea views down over Gulf Harbour marina\r\n* Private back yard for relaxed entertaining and summer evenings outdoors\r\n* Two modern bathrooms, one on each level\r\n* Heat pump plus HRV system for year-round comfort\r\n* Large carpeted double garage plus excellent storage throughout the home\r\n* Fully fenced, easy care, 325sqm freehold section\r\n* Treated timber construction with a cavity system\r\n* Security cameras for added peace of mind\r\n* Built-in TV and a generous walk-in wardrobe in one of the downstairs bedrooms\r\n* Excellent schools including Wentworth College & Primary\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour delivers an enviable coastal lifestyle within easy reach of beautiful beaches, parks, golf courses, the marina, local shops and excellent schooling. The bus stop is just a short stroll away, while nearby Shakespear Regional Park offers spectacular coastal walks, bike rides and beach days. With the Whangaparaoa Golf Course close at hand and the Gulf Harbour ferry connecting you to Auckland, you can enjoy the best of coastal living while keeping everyday essentials within easy reach.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today to arrange your viewing and discover the space, outlook and lifestyle waiting for you here.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 18th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JSQA\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome\r\n- Building report available",
